kernel/pd_soc.* and kernel/pd_dart_fixed.* are copies of ../kernel/pd_soc.* and
../kernel/pd_dart_fixed.* (the latter with one change, described in the file);
kernel/pd_admac.* is the ADMAC channel code of ../kernel/pd_mca.cpp as its own file.

The PMGR device table walk in kernel/pd_soc.cpp follows m1n1 src/pmgr.c; the DART
address filter set-up in kernel/pd_aop.cpp follows m1n1 src/dapf.c; the layout of
the AOP's boot arguments and the order of the audio power states were checked
against m1n1 proxyclient/m1n1/fw/aop/ and proxyclient/experiments/aop_audio.py.
